---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import DeliveryHero from "../../components/Delivery/DeliveryHero.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Delivery & Installation Policy"
  description="Delivery and Installation Policy for Mahakali Home Furnitures & Interiors."
  path="/delivery-policy"
>
  <main class="delivery-page">
    <DeliveryHero 
      title="Delivery & Installation" 
      subtitle="Everything you need to know about how we deliver and set up your new furniture."
    />
    
    <section class="policy-section wrap section">
      <div class="policy-container">
        <h2 class="font-display">Delivery & Installation Policy</h2>
        
        <ol class="delivery-list">
          <li>Delivery is available from <strong>Suratkal to Sirsi</strong> and surrounding areas.</li>
          <li>
            Delivery timelines:
            <ul class="nested-list">
              <li>In-stock products: <strong>3-10 days</strong></li>
              <li>Custom-made / manufactured products: <strong>15-35 days</strong></li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>The customer will be informed of the estimated delivery date at the time of order confirmation.</li>
          <li>Free delivery may be offered on selected products or minimum order values. Otherwise, delivery charges will apply.</li>
          <li>Installation assistance will be provided for products that require assembling.</li>
          <li>
            It is the customer's responsibility to check the following before placing an order:
            <ul class="nested-list">
              <li>Door size</li>
              <li>Lift availability</li>
              <li>Staircase width</li>
            </ul>
          </li>
          <li>If the delivery attempt fails due to customer unavailability, re-delivery charges may apply.</li>
          <li>Delivery timelines may vary due to traffic, weather, logistics issues, or unforeseen circumstances.</li>
          <li>Customers must inspect the product at the time of delivery. Any damages must be reported immediately with photos or videos.</li>
          <li>For multi-floor deliveries without lift access, additional manpower or handling charges may apply.</li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .policy-section {
    padding-top: 5rem;
    padding-bottom: 8rem;
  }
  .policy-container {
    max-width: 800px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    padding: 3rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-line);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .policy-container {
      padding: 1.5rem;
    }
  }
  
  .policy-container h2 {
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-line);
    padding-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  
  .policy-container ol.delivery-list {
    list-style-type: decimal;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
  }
  
  .policy-container li {
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }
  
  .policy-container strong {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    font-weight: 700;
  }
  
  .nested-list {
    list-style-type: disc !important;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
  }
  
  .nested-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
</style>
